WEBVTT

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:43.490
What is that?

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:47.120
That is Dromos.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.330
You know of it?

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:51.410
It is a weapon of mass destruction

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:56.830
born from the forbidden knowledge
humanity stole from us.

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:00.130
We cannot stay here!

00:01:12.390 --> 00:01:14.230
All forces,

00:01:14.390 --> 00:01:16.150
fall back at once.

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:19.020
We are moments away
from taking the castle! Why?

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:20.320
This is a direct order.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:23.530
We must not fight here any longer.

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.910
We must return to heaven immediately!

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.370
Why?! The humans are on their last legs!

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:32.040
Why will you not withdraw?

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:35.250
We should at least fall back without them.

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:45.510
What are you talking about?

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:52.770
We have not saved my mother yet.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:18.000
Rage of Bahamut

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:47.090
Seems like we popped up
in the middle of a battlefield.

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:50.260
We should move to an area
where we won't be seen.

00:03:58.220 --> 00:03:59.270
Hey, Rita!

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:00.690
Where are you going?!

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:44.690
What?!

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:47.690
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:13.630
Stop, El!

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:15.010
You must retreat with us!

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:48.580
El!

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:05.850
- Nina!
- Favaro!

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:33.690
Over there!

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:35.860
The human king is there!

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:38.030
Kill the king of man!

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:29.080
If this continues, we will be annihilated.

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:53.440
Don't...

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:56.480
Don't kill them!

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:14.540
Where's Favaro?!

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:15.710
I don't know.

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:19.130
I saw him get blown pretty far away.

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:28.260
Lady Jeanne!

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:32.430
Nina...

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:35.140
Where did you get blown away to?

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:40.320
Rage of Bahamut

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:58.080
It seems that you've successfully escaped
your prison.

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.260
Your eye...

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:07.300
I can still see you with one eye.

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:10.100
What are you after?!

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:11.680
What do you mean?

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:16.810
Disguising yourself when you're the king,
walking around the city, dancing with me!

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:19.100
So you want to dance again?

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:33.700
I have to save her!

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:35.040
Do not bother.

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:38.500
There is no escape now.

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:44.340
Help me.

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:46.090
Help you?

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:06.610
Hug me.

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:14.120
Hug me.

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:21.080
Hurry up and hug me!

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:04.330
I can actually transform into a dragon.

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:07.080
Nina!

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.090
Lady Jeanne!

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:12.460
This way!

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:58.630
Wow!

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:16.520
Keep your dirty mitts off a lady
when she's naked.

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:19.150
Who are you?

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:21.610
Just your average zombie passing by.

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:31.870
Stop.

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:35.790
Did you think I would let you get away?

00:17:45.010 --> 00:17:46.470
Go, Rita!

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:49.510
What about you?

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:51.430
Leave this to me!

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:55.730
You're really worried
about that dumb Afro, aren't you?

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:56.940
No!

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:58.480
Just go already!

00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:01.110
Don't die, okay?

00:18:25.590 --> 00:18:26.760
Get him!

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:28.510
Kill him!

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:34.600
Do not kill him.

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:42.020
The gods have retreated.

00:18:42.770 --> 00:18:44.320
That is good enough for now.

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:47.070
-We are returning to the castle.
-Yes, My Lord.

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:59.330
El is still unconscious.

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:02.670
How was the king of man

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:05.670
able to create such a thing?

00:19:06.050 --> 00:19:09.050
Do you mean the weapon?

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:12.850
That weapon is a relic of the old world

00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:19.310
from a time before man, demons,
and gods roamed Mistarcia.

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:23.900
Even if they had stolen
the stone slabs from us,

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:30.280
mankind should not have been able to
gather them together and actually build it.

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:35.830
That weapon has the power to destroy
the balance of the world

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:39.000
and lead it down the path
of its own destruction.

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:41.830
Just as Bahamut!

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:02.980
It's okay, it's okay
I cast the usual spell

00:20:03.150 --> 00:20:07.190
Stagnation, stagnation
My words and heart are at odds

00:20:07.360 --> 00:20:11.070
Default
I've taken all the paint

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:15.330
And mixed up all the colors
Until you're left with me

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:17.830
So fragile
Yet strong

00:20:17.990 --> 00:20:19.960
Close to overflowing
But not spilling

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:23.960
Because I'm incomplete
I won't amount to much

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:28.210
This is just a good luck charm
I'm not asking for your help

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:32.300
This is just a good luck charm
I was just clinging to you

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:36.600
Let's end it all today

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:40.890
I'm done living this pointless life

00:20:41.060 --> 00:20:44.900
Let's end it all today

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:49.820
I've taken my last, pointless breath

00:20:50.530 --> 00:20:54.530
To whom it may concern
See ya and goodbye

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:58.540
I killed the person I was yesterday

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:03.370
To whom it may concern
See ya and goodbye

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:10.380
A new morning is coming

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:27.110
Hey, was I okay?

00:21:27.270 --> 00:21:31.610
Yes, we were all able to live
thanks to you.

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:36.780
But we left Mister Kaisar and
Master Favaro behind, didn't we?

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:38.740
Also...

00:21:40.490 --> 00:21:41.490
That's true.

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:44.160
That's why I'm going to go take a look.

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:46.920
What?! It's too dangerous!

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:51.420
Nina, you stay with the holy maiden.

00:21:51.590 --> 00:21:53.510
And don't go back to the capital.

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:56.430
You're criminals and now escapees.

00:21:56.590 --> 00:21:57.680
What about you, Rita?

00:21:58.220 --> 00:21:59.760
I'm going back to the capital,

00:22:00.260 --> 00:22:02.720
to check on Kaisar and the Afro.

00:22:03.520 --> 00:22:04.940
Well...

00:22:05.480 --> 00:22:06.810
Take care of Nina.

00:22:08.440 --> 00:22:11.860
Wait, Rita!

00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:26.210
What should we do now?

00:22:26.920 --> 00:22:30.090
I would like to go to the land of the gods.

00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:31.290
What?

00:22:32.210 --> 00:22:34.760
El was there on that battlefield.

00:22:35.970 --> 00:22:37.800
That light was El.

00:22:39.470 --> 00:22:41.100
Mugaro?

00:22:41.970 --> 00:22:45.980
The gods must have withdrawn
back to their homelands.

00:22:46.180 --> 00:22:50.480
That is my only lead to find El.

00:22:51.940 --> 00:22:55.530
But I do not know where
the land of the gods is.

00:22:56.900 --> 00:22:59.280
Oh, I might be able to do
something about that.

00:22:59.450 --> 00:23:01.700
What? Is that true?

00:23:01.870 --> 00:23:06.450
Yeah, the old lady back in my village
would talk about it all the time.

00:23:06.620 --> 00:23:07.910
Village?

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:11.710
The Dragon Village! My hometown.

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:19.760
Then let us go to your village.

00:23:19.930 --> 00:23:21.510
What? Really?!

00:23:21.680 --> 00:23:24.720
Yes, we have no other leads.

00:23:33.020 --> 00:23:36.940
Go, Hippogriff!

00:23:46.580 --> 00:23:49.870
Behold, the power of Dromos!
The power of the stone!

00:23:50.040 --> 00:23:53.380
It synced with me and those hand beams
went boom! And boom!

00:23:53.540 --> 00:23:55.090
More valiant than anything!

00:23:55.250 --> 00:23:58.510
Next time on Rage of Bahamut:
Virgin Soul, "Homecoming"

00:23:58.760 --> 00:24:01.130
Beams went boom!

00:24:01.300 --> 00:24:03.800
BAHA SOUL!!

00:24:04.050 --> 00:24:06.180
Baha baha baha soul.

00:24:08.480 --> 00:24:10.890
Watch next time too, all right?
